    "detailed_description": "<strong>Space Vikings </strong>combines <strong>arena shooter</strong> and <strong>dungeon crawler</strong> gameplay elements in a sci-fi <strong>rogue-lite</strong> package.<br><br>Play as a member of the Space Vikings <strong>crew</strong>, each with their own stats and perks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/775da1a1a9e89eeb22c4d95bdab2cc86.poster.avif?t=1694205830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/775da1a1a9e89eeb22c4d95bdab2cc86.webm?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/775da1a1a9e89eeb22c4d95bdab2cc86.mp4?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Arm yourself with powerful and unusual <strong>weapons</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/35f1728713ec3c1a63ed005b5725c9c9.poster.avif?t=1694205830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/35f1728713ec3c1a63ed005b5725c9c9.webm?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/35f1728713ec3c1a63ed005b5725c9c9.mp4?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the <strong>map</strong> to explore mysterious alien planets in search of loot and plunder!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/e2efe81d5ead86432de3597066d31ca3.poster.avif?t=1694205830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/e2efe81d5ead86432de3597066d31ca3.webm?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Battle</strong> alien creatures until you're the only one standing and reap the rewards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/a5cd7067a7aa98e1313b07efeeb369f9.poster.avif?t=1694205830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/a5cd7067a7aa98e1313b07efeeb369f9.webm?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/a5cd7067a7aa98e1313b07efeeb369f9.mp4?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade your guns with powerful <strong>augments</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/9b10b1d3a4348683587cf475e91a374d.poster.avif?t=1694205830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/9b10b1d3a4348683587cf475e91a374d.webm?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457000/extras/9b10b1d3a4348683587cf475e91a374d.mp4?t=1694205830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
